data codex_app_server_subject_note: String = "THE SUBJECT IS the Codex app-server control interface (stdio/JSON-RPC style methods initialize, account/read, rateLimits/read, thread/turn) — not exec --json and not gunbc product policy. Observed against @openai/codex 0.146.0 in the provider-control-interface audit."

